Subject: [PATCH 4/5] web: unlock sensitive content from the viewer, hide
 people behind the PIN

The viewer offers the PIN prompt on a hidden sensitive asset (and does not
load its video), and a way to lock the session again once shown. A person's
menu gains Hide behind PIN / Stop hiding behind PIN.
